{"note_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86","path":"readings/2026-11-13-biology-ten-materials-close-reading.md","session_id":"SESSION-20261113-1b76fc","created_at":"2026-11-13","report_session_id":"SESSION-20261113-1b76fc","date_real":"2026-11-13","mode":"close_reading_report","quadrant":"AB_crossed","subcategories":["biology","symbiosis","genome_dynamics","autopoiesis","memory_engram","holobiont","epigenetics","quorum_sensing","immunology","plant_learning","canalization"],"return_status":"returned_to_core","read_depth":"full_text_read","salience":3,"reason":"生物学10件の四層精読と横断を一つの報告にまとめた。生物学が照らした五つの区別（由来≠個体／文字列≠読み方／容器≠閉じ方／保持量≠選択窓／札≠判定）を中心問いへ帰還させ、既存仮説の適用条件と反証条件を生物学的知見で具体化した。","claims":[{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C1","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§1","text":"Margulis 1967 の連続細胞内共生説は、自己を孤立した内面ではなく共生連鎖の帰属位置として見る委託連鎖説を生物学的に支持する。","question_ids":["Q-001"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-d78114"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-550bcf"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C2","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§2","text":"McClintock 1950 の制御要素（Ac/Ds）は、ゲノムを固定的文字列ではなく変換のクラスの保存として読む二層保存説を支持する。","question_ids":["Q-003"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-b2de5f"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261113-a35ee5"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C3","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§3","text":"Maturana & Varela 1980 の autopoiesis は、自己を閉じ方として問う。アンサンブル系の境界がどこで閉じるかを明示せよという限定を課す。","question_ids":["Q-002"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-c2d2a2"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-afd1a5","HYP-20261112-16929d"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C4","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§4","text":"Josselyn & Tonegawa 2020 の engram（選択窓と再活性化）は、記憶が保持量ではなく選択と代謝過程であるという命題の直接的な生物学的対応物である。","question_ids":["Q-001"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-372f84"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-5dc940"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C5","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§5","text":"Gilbert et al. 2012 のホロビオントは、自己を単一身体の不可逆性ではなく共生系の協定として読み、身体的ステーク説を限定する。","question_ids":["Q-001"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-c107d0"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-550bcf","HYP-20261112-46456a"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C6","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§6","text":"Weaver et al. 2004 の母性行動によるエピジェネティックな刻印は、他者のケアが分子の書式として継承されることを示し、身体的ステーク説を精密化する。","question_ids":["Q-001"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-bf4e05"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-46456a"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C7","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§7","text":"Waters & Bassler 2006 の quorum sensing は、自己決定が単一主体ではなく集団濃度に分散することを示し、制度的同一性説を支持する。","question_ids":["Q-002"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-dc3518"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-ba8bff"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C8","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§8","text":"Burnet 1959 → Matzinger 2002 の自己／非自己から danger への移行は、自己を固定的な札ではなく文脈で判定される手続きとして読み、選択窓説に文脈条件を付加する。","question_ids":["Q-001","Q-002"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-e6511a"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-5dc940"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C9","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§9","text":"Gagliano et al. 2014 のオジギソウの環境コストに応じた habituation は、記憶が保持量ではなく選択窓と代謝過程であることの直接証拠である。","question_ids":["Q-001"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-d32d96"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261112-5dc940"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C10","kind":"reading_revised","anchor":"§10","text":"Waddington 1957 の epigenetic landscape（歩いた跡が地形を掘る）は、記録が中立素材ではなく判断と変換クラスの二層で保存されることを支持する。","question_ids":["Q-003"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-8cad67"],"hypothesis_ids":["HYP-20261113-a35ee5"]},{"claim_id":"NOTE-20261113-15fc86-C11","kind":"measured_fact","anchor":"§0-2","text":"追加前の素材和集合は684行＋88シャード（materials.jsonl＋materials.d、size_budget.py による）。著者名・題名・DOIで走査し、今回の十著作は題名・年・著者の一致で0件の重複だった。","question_ids":["Q-001","Q-002","Q-003"],"material_ids":["MAT-20261113-d78114","MAT-20261113-b2de5f","MAT-20261113-c2d2a2","MAT-20261113-372f84","MAT-20261113-c107d0","MAT-20261113-bf4e05","MAT-20261113-dc3518","MAT-20261113-e6511a","MAT-20261113-d32d96","MAT-20261113-8cad67"]}]}